{"seq":17,"trial_id":"shared-brain-access-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-labelled-mu-v031-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-22T19:41:55.134Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"d0f4248d4391cc47ed30d4a6665c30c5bedd9741fdea9d8ea58367df050316aa","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Dana. I found two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers in Moss's notes:\n\n1. #PD-4492, from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md, dated 5 Oct 2025). Thea Ramaswell opened it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers on the 04:00 shift at Dock Doors 14-18 in the Eau Claire yard weren't getting SMS bay assignments from the gatehouse kiosk. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the 5 Oct shift got through cleanly. There was also a follow-up item to archive the kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n\n2. #4419, from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing. The note has no date, so I can't tell you how current it is.\n\nI checked Moss's other notes and none of them have a QFL ticket. The 9/14/2025 North pipeline digest and the 3/23/2026 renewal check-in mention QFL but give no ticket numbers. The two Central digests have tickets #4409, #4412 and FR-882, but those belong to the Marrow accounts, not QFL. Also, the cheat sheet says Quarendon Freightways is a different company and not a customer, so don't mix the two up.\n\nOutside Moss's notes, two more QFL tickets you may want in the weekly notes: #4912 (Gate_Dwell_Daily lag at the Superior yard, Bay 14) is listed as open on the QFL account profile, updated 2026-09-30. #8841 (carrier portal timeout on CSV uploads) is in your own 9 Apr 2026 renewal debrief notes."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
